acerca.nombre = The name honours Ibanasca, mother of water and protective goddess of the snow-capped mountains in the Pijao culture of Tolima (Colombia). According to tradition, she was burned during the conquest and purified by the god of fire. The project does not claim to represent the deity or to speak for the Pijao people.
